---
---
<section class="py-20 border-t border-gray-200/50 relative z-10 px-6 max-w-7xl mx-auto w-full">
  <div class="bg-background-200 border border-gray-200 rounded-sm p-8 sm:p-12 md:p-16 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-12 items-center justify-between">
    <div class="max-w-xl">
      <h2 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-tertiary mb-3">Security & Trust</h2>
      <h3 class="text-heading-32 sm:text-heading-40 font-bold text-gray-1000 tracking-tight mb-6">
        Privacy first, by engineering.
      </h3>
      <p class="text-copy-15 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
        We believe that anonymity is the foundation of genuine peer support. Our platform is designed with mathematical guarantees to protect student identities:
      </p>

      <ul class="space-y-4">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-emerald-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
          </svg>
          <div>
            <strong class="text-gray-1000 text-sm block">Hash-and-Discard Verification</strong>
            <span class="text-xs text-gray-600">Your university email is only processed to verify active student status. We generate a secure cryptographic hash for rate-limiting, then discard the raw email instantly.</span>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-emerald-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
          </svg>
          <div>
            <strong class="text-gray-1000 text-sm block">Zero PII (Personally Identifiable Information)</strong>
            <span class="text-xs text-gray-600">We do not store your name, student ID number, location, IP address, or browser metadata. Your identity cannot be reverse-engineered.</span>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-emerald-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
          </svg>
          <div>
            <strong class="text-gray-1000 text-sm block">Encrypted Database Logs</strong>
            <span class="text-xs text-gray-600">All message bodies, forum posts, and event registrations are encrypted at rest. Databases cannot associate messages with real-world users.</span>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Right Shield Graphic -->
    <div class="flex-shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center bg-background-100 border border-gray-200 w-48 h-48 sm:w-64 sm:h-64 rounded-full relative">
      <svg class="h-16 w-16 text-tertiary animate-pulse" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
      </svg>
      <div class="absolute inset-4 rounded-full border border-gray-200/50 border-dashed animate-[spin_40s_linear_infinite]"></div>
      <div class="absolute inset-10 rounded-full border border-tertiary/20 animate-[spin_20s_linear_infinite_reverse]"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
